(21, 1, '2026-05-11 14:21:26', '2026-05-11 14:21:26', '<h2 \n		data-interaction-id=\"e56d601\" \n		class=\"e-e56d601-7fa88a2 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			This is creavy\n		</h2>\n							<h1 \n		data-interaction-id=\"e244c52\" \n		class=\"e-e244c52-714f516 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			SOCIAL MEDIA\n		</h1>\n										<a href=\"#\">\n									Click here...  \n					</a>\n											<h4 \n		data-interaction-id=\"7aa1635\" \n		class=\"e-7aa1635-622d349 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			AS  SEEN  IN\n		</h4>\n							<h2 \n		data-interaction-id=\"4b53f5f\" \n		class=\"e-4b53f5f-fb1e7ac e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			GQ\n		</h2>\n							<h2 \n		data-interaction-id=\"efe0e09\" \n		class=\"e-efe0e09-eaf6d43 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			LOMOON<br> WEEX\n		</h2>\n							<h2 \n		data-interaction-id=\"69b8be6\" \n		class=\"e-69b8be6-9b7e9ab e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			VOGLE\n		</h2>\n							<h2 \n		data-interaction-id=\"d5bb136\" \n		class=\"e-d5bb136-52f3860 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			GLAMOUR\n		</h2>\n							<h2 \n		data-interaction-id=\"817628c\" \n		class=\"e-817628c-a6a16e9 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			WELCOME TO\n		</h2>\n							<h2 \n		data-interaction-id=\"f16e364\" \n		class=\"e-f16e364-7764390 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			THE AGENCY\n		</h2>\n								<p data-interaction-id=\"686e318\"  >\n								Fashion Design is more than creating beautiful clothes — it is a way of expressing personality, <br>culture, and creativity through style.<br><br>Fashion designers combine colors, fabrics, textures, and modern trends to create unique pieces that inspire confidence and individuality.<br>In today’s world, fashion design plays an important role in art, <br><br>business, and social media.\n					</p>\n			<img \n					data-interaction-id=\"67509ed\" \n									id=\"146\"\n												src=\"http://localhost/habibi/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/black-section.png\"\n												width=\"139\"\n												height=\"150\"\n												srcset=\"\"\n												alt=\"\"\n						/>\n								<h2 \n		data-interaction-id=\"f06483a\" \n		class=\"e-f06483a-4828d78 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			OUR PRODUCT\n		</h2>\n							<h2 \n		data-interaction-id=\"07189b4\" \n		class=\"e-07189b4-106e6e6 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			In today’s world, fashion design plays an important role in art, <br>business, and social mediacreativity through style. Fashion designers <br>combine colors, fabrics, textures, and modern .<br>\n		</h2>\n															<img width=\"736\" height=\"783\" src=\"http://localhost/habibi/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/سومی.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																    	            <button data-interaction-id=\"0f5b9a6\"  >\n            CONTACT CREATION\n        </button>\n    															<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"http://localhost/habibi/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/عطر.png\" alt=\"\" />																    	            <button data-interaction-id=\"2982878\"  >\n            SOIAL STRATEGY\n        </button>\n    															<img width=\"1024\" height=\"819\" src=\"http://localhost/habibi/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/لوسیون.png\" alt=\"\" />																    	            <button data-interaction-id=\"2661799\"  >\n            Advertising brand\n        </button>\n    															<img width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"http://localhost/habibi/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/قهوه-1.png\" alt=\"\" />																		<h2 \n		data-interaction-id=\"147e6a6\" \n		class=\"e-147e6a6-d7a7a48 e-heading-base\" \n	>\n			~ OUR BRAND\n		</h2>\n								<p data-interaction-id=\"a6ddba2\"  >\n								Our products are carefully selected to bring out your natural glow while giving your skin the care it deserves. From luxurious fragrances to elegant cosmetics and soft body lotions, every item is designed to make you feel beautiful every single day That’s why we focus on high-quality products that combine style, comfort, and self-care.\n					</p>\n					<button id=\"e-n-tab-title-1407103781\" data-tab-title-id=\"e-n-tab-title-1407103781\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab-index=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"